      {
        "Original": "Draw Additional Debug Information",
        "Translated": "绘制其他调试信息",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawRendering",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "PreserveID": true,
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox"
      },
      {
        "Original": "Draws verbose debug information below trap markers etc. Used to report obviously fake or incorrect trap submissions to the server administrator for investigation.",
        "Translated": "在陷阱标记等下方绘制详细的调试信息。用于向服务器管理员报告明显虚假或不正确的陷阱提交以进行调查。",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawRendering",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
      },
      {
        "Original": "Fills the marker with a faded version of its colour. Off leaves the outer ring only, so you can still see the ground underneath.\n\nDirectX render mode only. VFX omens are the game's own filled effects.",
        "Translated": "用褪色版的颜色填充标记。关闭后只留下外圈，这样你仍然可以看到下面的地面。\n\n仅限 DirectX 渲染模式。视觉特效预兆是游戏自身的内置效果。",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawMarkerSection",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
      },
      {
        "Original": "How many players have to confirm the same spot before Palantir shows it to you.\n\nTraps and hoards you find yourself always show up, however low the number.\n\n0 shows everything, even a spot only one person has ever reported, mistakes included.\n\nHigher numbers are more trustworthy, but markers take longer to appear and rarely discovered ones may never show up at all.\n\nRecommended: 4 for traps, 2 for the Accursed Hoard. Traps are in nearly every room, so they reach 4 confirmations quickly. There is only one potential hoard per floor, so these accumulate confirmations much less quickly.",
        "Translated": "多少玩家需要确认同一个位置才能让帕兰提尔向你展示？\n\n你发现自己身上的陷阱和储备总是会出现，无论数量多么少。\n\n0 显示了一切，甚至包括一个只有一个人报告过的地点，包括错误。\n\n数字越大越可靠，但标记物需要更长时间才能出现，而那些很少被发现的标记物可能永远不会出现。\n\n推荐:4 个用于陷阱，2 个用于恶性囤积。几乎每个房间都有陷阱，所以他们很快就能确认 4 个。每层只有一个潜在的囤积，所以这些确认的积累速度要慢得多。",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawMarkerSection",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
      },
      {
        "Original": "How far from you markers are drawn. Large values cost frame time.",
        "Translated": "标记被绘制的距离有多远？大值的成本是帧时间。",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawMarkerSection",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
      },
      {
        "Original": "DirectX is the default. Markers are drawn over the game, so they stay visible through walls, enemies and other players.\n\nVFX uses the game's own omen effects. They look native and sit on the ground, but anything in front of them hides them, and they are easy to mistake for an enemy's attack telegraph.",
        "Translated": "DirectX 是默认设置。标记是在游戏中绘制的，因此它们可以透过墙壁、敌人和其他玩家保持可见。\n\nVFX 使用了游戏自身的预兆效果。它们看起来像是本地人，坐在地上，但前方的一切都会将它们隐藏起来，很容易被误认为是敌人的攻击电报。",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawMarkerSection",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker"
      },
      {
        "Original": "Traps",
        "Translated": "陷阱",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawMarkerSection",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted"
      },
      {
        "Original": "Only applies to the DirectX render mode. VFX omens are the game's own filled effects.",
        "Translated": "仅适用于 DirectX 渲染模式。VFX 预兆是游戏自身的填充效果。",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawRow",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip"
      },
      {
        "Original": "Enable both traps and the Accursed Hoard to merge them.",
        "Translated": "使两个陷阱和诅咒储备能够合并。",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawMergeToggle",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip"
      },
      {
        "Original": "Both categories must use the DirectX render mode. VFX omens are separate game objects and cannot be blended into one marker.",
        "Translated": "两个类别都必须使用 DirectX 渲染模式。VFX 元素是独立的游戏对象，不能混合成一个标记。",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawMergeToggle",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
        "Role": "UI",
        "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip"
      },
      {
        "Original": "Traps must be filled to merge. The merged marker uses the trap colour as its body and the hoard colour as its outline.",
        "Translated": "陷阱必须被填充才能合并。合并的标记使用陷阱颜色作为其主体，而储藏颜色作为其轮廓。",
        "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawMergeToggle",
        "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
